Section: doc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcspecial
Description: manuals, designs and example configurations for tcspecial
 The TCS manuals and design documents, TCS Design and Documentation at their
 head, as HTML with their figures and screenshots, under
 /opt/tcs/share/doc/tcspecial-doc, and the example configurations, in both
 spellings with their simulator files and diagrams, which the manuals'
 figures come from, under /opt/tcs/share/examples/tcspecial.
 Documentation alone: no program, and nothing a vehicle or a ground station
 needs to run.
